{"id":"89152b1252304fa8","group":"14","path":"14/14-thm-ipc-subobject-soundness.md","title":"Theorem — IPC 在子对象 Heyting 代数中的可靠性","display":"Theorem — IPC 在子对象 Heyting 代数中的可靠性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-thm-ipc-subobject-soundness","aliases":["14-thm-ipc-subobject-soundness"],"display":"Theorem — IPC 在子对象 Heyting 代数中的可靠性","depends_on":["[[14-df-provable]]","[[14-df-subobject-quantifiers]]","[[14-df-heyting-algebra]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-thm-ipc-subobject-soundness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-thm-ipc-subobject-soundness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Theorem — IPC 在子对象 Heyting 代数中的可靠性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a437620e31ab5c03\" href=\"?note=a437620e31ab5c03\" title=\"14-df-provable\">14-df-provable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0b6a2f7cb930ac02\" href=\"?note=0b6a2f7cb930ac02\" title=\"14-df-subobject-quantifiers\">14-df-subobject-quantifiers</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"91189e210bff4156\" href=\"?note=91189e210bff4156\" title=\"14-df-heyting-algebra\">14-df-heyting-algebra</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4e6c05c92e3b9bf9\" href=\"?note=4e6c05c92e3b9bf9\" title=\"14-df-elementary-topos\">14-df-elementary-topos</a> 的初等拓扑斯，指定终对象 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span>、分类子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\Omega,\\top)\">\\((\\Omega,\\top)\\)</span> 与有限极限。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\in\\mathcal U\">\\(P\\in\\mathcal U\\)</span> 为命题字母集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\">\\(X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v:\\mathrm{PFml}(P)\\to\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(X)\">\\(v:\\mathrm{PFml}(P)\\to\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(X)\\)</span> 为赋值，命题字母上的限制任意，并满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v(\\bot)=\\bot_X\">\\(v(\\bot)=\\bot_X\\)</span> 及对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b\\in\\mathrm{PFml}(P)\">\\(a,b\\in\\mathrm{PFml}(P)\\)</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v(a\\wedge b)=v(a)\\wedge_Xv(b)\">\\(v(a\\wedge b)=v(a)\\wedge_Xv(b)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v(a\\vee b)=v(a)\\vee_Xv(b)\">\\(v(a\\vee b)=v(a)\\vee_Xv(b)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v(a\\to b)=v(a)\\Rightarrow_Xv(b)\">\\(v(a\\to b)=v(a)\\Rightarrow_Xv(b)\\)</span>；公式语法见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a437620e31ab5c03\" href=\"?note=a437620e31ab5c03\" title=\"14-df-provable\">14-df-provable</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{PFml}(P)\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{PFml}(P)\\)</span> 有限，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{PFml}(P)\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{PFml}(P)\\)</span>；空交约定为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\top_X\">\\(\\top_X\\)</span>。此结论仅涉及 IPC，未声明任意一阶推导的可靠性。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Provable}_{\\mathrm{IPC}}(\\Gamma,\\varphi)\\Rightarrow\\bigwedge_{\\psi\\in\\Gamma}v(\\psi)\\le v(\\varphi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Provable}_{\\mathrm{IPC}}(\\Gamma,\\varphi)\\Rightarrow\\bigwedge_{\\psi\\in\\Gamma}v(\\psi)\\le v(\\varphi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>证明：Heyting 伴随逐项验证九个公理模式取值为 ⊤；modus ponens 由 a∧(a⇒b)≤b 保持。对有限证明长度归纳，并在前提赋值的有限交下进行。有限前提避免任意初等拓扑斯中无界交不存在。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-provable","status":"resolved","id":"a437620e31ab5c03","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-provable]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-subobject-quantifiers","status":"resolved","id":"0b6a2f7cb930ac02","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-subobject-quantifiers]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-heyting-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"91189e210bff4156","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-heyting-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-elementary-topos","status":"resolved","id":"4e6c05c92e3b9bf9","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 为 [[14-df-elementary-topos]] 的初等拓扑斯，指定终对象 $1$、分类子 $(\\Omega,\\top)$ 与有限极限。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-provable","status":"resolved","id":"a437620e31ab5c03","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$P\\in\\mathcal U$ 为命题字母集，$X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)$；$v:\\mathrm{PFml}(P)\\to\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(X)$ 为赋值，命题字母上的限制任意，并满足 $v(\\bot)=\\bot_X$ 及对所有 $a,b\\in\\mathrm{PFml}(P)$ 有 $v(a\\wedge b)=v(a)\\wedge_Xv(b)$、$v(a\\vee b)=v(a)\\vee_Xv(b)$、$v(a\\to b)=v(a)\\Rightarrow_Xv(b)$；公式语法见 [[14-df-provable]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"(\\Omega,\\top)","display":false},{"tex":"P\\in\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)","display":false},{"tex":"v:\\mathrm{PFml}(P)\\to\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(X)","display":false},{"tex":"v(\\bot)=\\bot_X","display":false},{"tex":"a,b\\in\\mathrm{PFml}(P)","display":false},{"tex":"v(a\\wedge b)=v(a)\\wedge_Xv(b)","display":false},{"tex":"v(a\\vee b)=v(a)\\vee_Xv(b)","display":false},{"tex":"v(a\\to b)=v(a)\\Rightarrow_Xv(b)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{PFml}(P)","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{PFml}(P)","display":false},{"tex":"\\top_X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Provable}_{\\mathrm{IPC}}(\\Gamma,\\varphi)\\Rightarrow\\bigwedge_{\\psi\\in\\Gamma}v(\\psi)\\le v(\\varphi).","display":true}],"bytes":1518,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-204","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-ipc-subobject-soundness|Theorem — IPC 在子对象 Heyting 代数中的可靠性]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-57","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-ipc-subobject-soundness]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-205","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-ipc-subobject-soundness|Theorem — IPC 在子对象 Heyting 代数中的可靠性]]"}],"outgoing":["a437620e31ab5c03","0b6a2f7cb930ac02","91189e210bff4156","4e6c05c92e3b9bf9"]}